{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"5d5394097628cd71","type":"group","x":2560,"y":-120,"width":1020,"height":1270,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"ac7bbf33eaac9352","type":"group","x":-1720,"y":-1885,"width":998,"height":1276,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"5c4010c19897d994","type":"group","x":440,"y":-2555,"width":860,"height":1340,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"15228d828a63f159","type":"group","x":1440,"y":-1400,"width":960,"height":1186,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"c300723391dc285b","type":"group","x":1000,"y":760,"width":1040,"height":1000,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"2dc7e747595acf90","type":"group","x":-2840,"y":280,"width":970,"height":1050,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"6ede578b06a3934d","type":"group","x":-2840,"y":-760,"width":1060,"height":951,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"617ec687842f33b7","type":"group","x":-240,"y":1800,"width":1000,"height":952,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"30d7ddfc86e2d66d","type":"group","x":-1600,"y":865,"width":824,"height":790,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"83d61e60309af3bc","type":"group","x":1280,"y":120,"width":820,"height":484,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"n-1","type":"text","text":"## SERVICES\n### Enumeration","x":-130,"y":-50,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-72","type":"text","text":"## NFS","x":-720,"y":-152,"width":220,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-82","type":"text","text":"## MySQL / MSSQL","x":-508,"y":-519,"width":220,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-94","type":"text","text":"## UNKNOWN\n### SERVICE","x":-130,"y":1055,"width":260,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-88","type":"text","text":"### MySQL Enum Once Inside\n\n```\nshow databases;\nuse <db>;\nshow tables;\ndescribe <table>;\nselect * from <table>;\n```\nSkip default DBs (mysql, information_schema, performance_schema).","x":-1202,"y":-1379,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-84","type":"text","text":"### MySQL Connect\n\n```\nmysql -u root -p -h [ip] --skip-ssl\nmysql -u root -h [ip] -e \"select version();\"\n```","x":-1202,"y":-1880,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-96","type":"text","text":"### Deep Scan First\n\n```\nsudo nmap -p [port] -sCV -A [ip]\n```","x":-220,"y":1820,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-100","type":"text","text":"### Port Lookup\n\n```\nhttps://www.speedguide.net/port.php?port=[number]\n```","x":-220,"y":2288,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-46","type":"text","text":"### Basic Query\n\n```\ndig any [domain] @[target-ip]\n```","x":1020,"y":780,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-50","type":"text","text":"### Subdomain Brute Force\n\n```\ndnsenum [domain]\ndnsrecon -d target.com -D wordlist.txt -t brt -n 1.1.1.1,8.8.8.8\nfierce --domain target.com\n```","x":1020,"y":1248,"width":460,"height":232,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-48","type":"text","text":"### Zone Transfer (Big Win)\n\n```\ndig axfr [domain] @[target-ip]\n```\nMisconfigured servers dump full record set: subdomains + internal IPs.","x":1540,"y":1040,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-52","type":"text","text":"### Hierarchy Reminder\n\nRoot (.) → TLD (.com/.in) → Authoritative Name Server → A/MX/NS records. Check `/etc/hosts` for local overrides too.","x":1540,"y":1520,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-98","type":"text","text":"### Banner Grabbing\n\n```\nnc -vvv [ip] [port]\nopenssl s_client -connect [ip]:[port]\n```\nUse openssl s_client if the port wraps TLS (banner grab over encrypted channel).","x":280,"y":2078,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-102","type":"text","text":"### Last Resort\n\n```\nnmap -sV --version-all -p[port] [ip]\n```\nThen capture traffic in Wireshark while interacting manually to fingerprint the protocol.","x":280,"y":2522,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-86","type":"text","text":"### MySQL Brute Force\n\n```\nhydra -C /usr/share/wordlists/seclists/Passwords/Default-Credentials/mssql-betterdefaultpasslist.txt mysql://[ip]\n```","x":-1662,"y":-1613,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-90","type":"text","text":"### MSSQL Connect\n\n```\nimpacket-mssqlclient sa:Password@1@[ip]\nimpacket-mssqlclient user:Password@1@[ip] -windows-auth\n```","x":-1662,"y":-1121,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-92","type":"text","text":"### MSSQL Priv Esc Path\n\n```\nEXEC sp_configure 'show advanced options', 1;\nRECONFIGURE;\nEXEC sp_configure 'xp_cmdshell', 1;\nRECONFIGURE;\nEXEC xp_cmdshell 'whoami';\n```\nIf `sa` has sysadmin, this chains straight to OS command execution.","x":-1202,"y":-857,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-56","type":"text","text":"### NSE Scripts\n\n```\nnmap --script smtp* -p25 [ip]\n```","x":-1580,"y":885,"width":380,"height":210,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-60","type":"text","text":"### Manual Interaction\n\n```\nnc -vvv [ip] 25\nHELO test\nVRFY root\n```\nHosted providers (Gmail/Outlook) usually disable VRFY; self-hosted mail servers are the real target.","x":-1580,"y":1353,"width":380,"height":282,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-58","type":"text","text":"### User Enum via VRFY\n\n```\nsmtp-user-enum -M VRFY -U /usr/share/wordlists/seclists/Usernames/Names/names.txt -t [ip]\n```\n`250` = exists, `550` = does not exist.","x":-1156,"y":1143,"width":380,"height":210,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-54","type":"text","text":"## SMTP","x":-646,"y":599,"width":220,"height":71,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-44","type":"text","text":"## DNS","x":480,"y":599,"width":220,"height":71,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-40","type":"text","text":"### NetBIOS Name Scan\n\n```\nnbtscan [ip]\nnmap -sU --script nbstat.nse -p137 [ip]\n```\nGets NetBIOS computer name, MAC, domain/workgroup.","x":1300,"y":140,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n-42","type":"text","text":"### Part of SMB Family\n\nNetBIOS (139) aur SMB (445) same enumeration flow share karte hain, most tools dono cover karte hain automatically (enum4linux, smbclient).","x":1620,"y":394,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n-38","type":"text","text":"## NetBIOS","x":646,"y":245,"width":220,"height":67,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n-26","type":"text","text":"## SMB","x":700,"y":-28,"width":220,"height":57,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-32","type":"text","text":"### Full Enum (Linux target)\n\n```\nenum4linux-ng -A [ip]\nrpcclient -N -U \"\" [ip]\nsmbmap -H [ip]\nnbtscan [ip]\n```","x":2580,"y":368,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-36","type":"text","text":"### Access Share + Vuln Check\n\n```\nsmbclient //[ip]/[share] -N\n> ls\n> get file\n\nnmap --script smb-vuln* -p445 [ip]\n```","x":2580,"y":835,"width":460,"height":248,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-30","type":"text","text":"### 3 Login Types\n\n```\n# Null session\nsmbclient -N -U \"\" -L //[ip]\n\n# Guest\nsmbclient -U 'guest%' -L //[ip]\n\n# Valid creds\nsmbclient -U 'user%pass' -L //[ip]\n```","x":3100,"y":158,"width":460,"height":315,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-34","type":"text","text":"### Modern Tooling\n\n```\nnxc smb [ip] -u '' -p '' --shares\nnxc smb [ip] -u '' -p '' --users\n```\n(netexec binary renamed to nxc)","x":3100,"y":625,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-28","type":"text","text":"### Deep Scan\n\n```\nsudo nmap [ip] -p445,139 -sCV --min-rate=300\n```","x":2580,"y":-100,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-14","type":"text","text":"## SSH","x":540,"y":-519,"width":418,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-16","type":"text","text":"### Banner + Version Check\n\n```\nnc -vvv [ip] 22\n```\nCheck version against searchsploit: `searchsploit openssh [version]`","x":1460,"y":-1380,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-18","type":"text","text":"### Password Login\n\n```\nssh user@[ip]\nssh user@[ip] -p [port]\n```","x":1920,"y":-1170,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-20","type":"text","text":"### Key-Based Login\n\n```\nchmod 600 id_rsa\nssh user@[ip] -i id_rsa\n```\nUse 600 not 400 if key has group perms issues on some distros","x":1460,"y":-912,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-22","type":"text","text":"### No Creds? Brute Force\n\n```\nhydra -l [user] -P rockyou.txt -t 4 ssh://[ip]\n```\n-t 4 limits threads, avoids account lockout / fail2ban trigger","x":1900,"y":-740,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-24","type":"text","text":"### File Transfer + Enum\n\n```\nscp file user@ip:/path\nsftp user@ip\nssh-keyscan -t rsa [ip]\n```","x":1460,"y":-444,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-2","type":"text","text":"## FTP","x":200,"y":-544,"width":220,"height":50,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-4","type":"text","text":"### Connect + Anonymous Check\n\n```\nftp [ip]\nftp [ip] -p [port]\n```\nTry: `anonymous:anonymous`, `ftp:ftp`, `anonymous:[blank]`","x":460,"y":-2535,"width":460,"height":240,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-6","type":"text","text":"### NSE Confirm\n\n```\nnmap --script ftp-anon -p21 [ip]\n```\nBanner: `vsftpd 3.0.3` + `ftp-anon: Anonymous login allowed (230)`","x":820,"y":-2235,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-12","type":"text","text":"### TFTP (No Auth, UDP 69)\n\n```\ntftp [ip]\n> get [file]\n> put [file]\n```\nDefault dir: `/var/lib/tftpboot`","x":460,"y":-1435,"width":460,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-10","type":"text","text":"### No Login? Brute Force\n\n```\nhydra -C /usr/share/wordlists/seclists/Passwords/Default-Credentials/ftp-betterdefaultpasslist.txt ftp://[ip]\n```","x":820,"y":-1700,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-8","type":"text","text":"### Inside Actions\n\n```\nls -la\npassive off\nprompt off\nmget *\nget file.txt\n!<local-cmd>\n```","x":460,"y":-1995,"width":460,"height":260,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-104","type":"text","text":"## 0. Start Here\n\n```\nsudo nmap -p- -sCV --min-rate=300 [ip] -oA scan\nsudo nmap -A -p- --min-rate=300 {ip}\n```\nHost discovery → full port scan → deep scan with default scripts + version detection.","x":-330,"y":-2108,"width":640,"height":243,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n-62","type":"text","text":"## SNMP","x":-646,"y":245,"width":220,"height":67,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n-78","type":"text","text":"### Mount + Explore\n\n```\nmkdir target-NFS\nsudo mount -t nfs [ip]:/ ./target-NFS/ -o nolock\nsudo umount ./target-NFS\n```","x":-2260,"y":-272,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-74","type":"text","text":"### List Exports\n\n```\nshowmount -e [ip]\nshowmount -a [ip]\n```\n-a shows currently active client mounts too.","x":-2260,"y":-740,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-80","type":"text","text":"### Post-Access Notes\n\n```\ncat /etc/exports\n```\nLinux-only protocol. Versions v2/v3/v4/v4.1/v4.2 differ in auth model, mostly still no auth by default.","x":-2800,"y":-29,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-76","type":"text","text":"### NSE Scripts\n\n```\nsudo nmap --script nfs* [ip] -sV -p111,2049\n```","x":-2800,"y":-506,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-64","type":"text","text":"### Community String Brute Force\n\n```\nonesixtyone -c /usr/share/wordlists/seclists/Discovery/SNMP/snmp-onesixtyone.txt [ip]\n```\nDefaults: `public` (read), `private` (write).","x":-2350,"y":300,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n-66","type":"text","text":"### Full Walk (root OID)\n\n```\nsnmpwalk -c public -v2c [ip] .1\nsnmpbulkwalk -c public -v2c [ip]\nsnmp-check [ip] -c public\n```\n`.1` walks entire MIB tree from the top, not just one branch.","x":-2810,"y":557,"width":460,"height":233,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n-70","type":"text","text":"### Version Notes\n\nv1/v2c = plaintext community strings (sniffable). v3 = encrypted + authenticated, harder target.","x":-2810,"y":1084,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n-68","type":"text","text":"### Targeted OID Pull\n\n```\nbraa public@[ip]:.1.3.6.1.2.1.1.1.0\n```\nSystem info, running processes, users, sometimes credentials leak directly.","x":-2350,"y":838,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"6"}
	],
